==English==

===Etymology===
[[up]] + [[load]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{transitive|intransitive|computing}} to [[transfer]] [[data]] or [[file]]s from a [[peripheral]] or [[subordinate]] [[system]] to a [[larger]] or more [[central]] one; especially from a [[personal computer]] to an [[Internet]] [[server]].
#: ''You will have to convert your photograph to a jpg format if you wish to '''upload''' it.''

====Derived terms====
* [[uploader]]

